{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/99286-insect-swarm-and-other-demonic-powers","id":99286,"title":"Insect Swarm and other demonic powers","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness","Demon: The Descent"],"posts":[{"date":"2014-03-26T10:34:08-07:00","id":99286,"title":"Insect Swarm and other demonic powers","content":"In chatting with a friend of mine, an issue that came up in his game came up. A PC with Insect Swarm process and Electric Jolt Technology attacks a group of people. Using his electricity powers, does he do 6 Bashing to each, 7 Bashing to each, or 6 Bashing to one?<br /> <br /> I was inclined toward 6 Bashing to each but then I care less about &quot;game balance&quot; than some.<br /> <br /> What are your thoughts?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/463-derendel","name":"Derendel","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar463_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"39"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-03-26T13:17:16-07:00","id":99463,"title":"","content":"I would have said the electricity would have spread out equally, and then one bashing from the swarm, but that's just because that's how I envision it working from a story perspective - each part of the swarm would have had a smaller &quot;battery&quot; to shock with. So, a swarm attacking, say, three people would deal 3 bashing damage to each. Two from the electricity, one from the swarm tilt. <br /> <br /> Balance wise, I don't have an issue with 7 bashing to each person. The above is just my gut reaction.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2102-mcn","name":"MCN","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2102_3.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3479"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-03-26T13:26:40-07:00","id":99474,"title":"","content":"I think I have to go with MCN here. you've got a &quot;pool&quot; that is split between the targets, then another point from the swarm.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1734-asaram","name":"Asaram","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1734_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"331"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}